      "created_at": "2011-09-16T11:38:58.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Do you have Adobe Reader or Foxit Reader or xpdf or OpenOffice/LibreOffice Draw something?  One of those are required to open the file.  If you do have one of those and can’t open it, maybe it’s getting corrupt when downloading. If it can open, but can’t print, maybe something wrong with your printer? or something wrong between the printer and the app you are printing from?</p>",
